   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Having to do something",
     "texto": [
      "**Πρέπει να** + verb expresses obligation: **Πρέπει να καθαρίσω** (I have to clean). After **να**, the verb usually takes a different form from the usual present.",
      "**Μπορώ να** means «I can». Use **εγώ** («I») or **εσύ** («you») to make clear who does the task; it is often understood from the verb ending."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
